msgstr "ROS 2 CLI"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:98 075d741f0ee34dd1a13cda6a36305e95
msgid ""
"Once everything is running, you can now interact with ArduPilot through "
"the ROS 2 CLI."
msgstr "一切运行正常后，您现在可以通过 ROS 2 CLI 与 ArduPilot 交互。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:110 2de7cf8f0c0540398dbbd6d20fc79f2e
msgid ""
"DDS is responsible for ROS2 communication. If the ROS2 topics are not "
"published, first check if *DDS_ENABLE* is set to ``1`` or not. If not, "
"set as ``1``. It can be done through Mission Planner, QGroundControl, or "
"the commands in *mavproxy* as below, then reboot the launch."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:121 9658548dbdfd4a7081f97a540adbc3a4
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The second aspect to check, ensure the ArduPilot parameter "
":ref:`DDS_DOMAIN_ID<DDS_DOMAIN_ID>` matches your environment variable "
"``ROS_DOMAIN_ID``.The default is ``0`` for ArduPilot, which corresponds "
"to the environment variable being unset. You may need to relaunch the "
"SITL after changing the parameters."
msgstr ""
"另外需要检查：确保 ArduPilot 参数 ref:`DDS_DOMAIN_ID<DDS_DOMAIN_ID>` 与您的环境变量 "
"``ROS_DOMAIN_ID`` 一致。ArduPilot 的默认值为 ``0``，对应于环境变量未设置的情况。"

